  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1061929/description_c7b3b6c0-46f2-44ad-9324-80286246dc0c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p>在罕見的混沌之月事件期間，Born In Chaos 生物生成的權重將大幅增加；而在超級混沌之月期間，所有生物生成數量也會大幅上升，導致世界被混沌淹沒。在這兩種月亮期間，BIC 生物的掉落物將翻倍。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enhanced-celestials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enhanced Celestials</a> 的原作者為 CorgiTaco。</p>\n<p>依賴：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born In Chaos</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/kpN4eRbVsS\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/ElWh0NdXEAE7Put.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"300\" height=\"132\"> </a></p>",
